span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</button>\n<button class=\"checkrow flex min-h-[64px] w-full items-center gap-3 rounded-[12px] px-3 py-2 text-left\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-2-7\" data-name=\"passing check row: Page kept up to date\">\n<i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ph ph-check shrink-0 text-[18px] text-[#019FB7]\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-2-7-1\" data-name=\"checkmark icon for passing check\"></i>\n<span class=\"min-w-0 flex-1\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-2-7-2\" data-name=\"check row text content\">\n<span class=\"block text-[14px] font-semibold leading-[1.3]\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-2-7-2-1\" data-name=\"check title: Signs the page is kept up to date\" style=\"font-family:'Bricolage Grotesque',system-ui,sans-serif\">Signs the page is kept up to date</span>\n<span class=\"mt-1.5 flex items-center gap-2 text-[12px] text-[#696773]\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-2-7-2-2\" data-name=\"check score and progress\">\n<span class=\"shrink-0\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-2-7-2-2-1\" data-name=\"check score text: 10 of 10 points\">10 of 10 points</span>\n<span class=\"h-[3px] w-[32px] overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-[#E3E7EA]\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-2-7-2-2-2\" data-name=\"check progress bar (full)\"><span class=\"block h-full w-full rounded-full bg-[#019FB7]\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-1-2-7-2-2-2-1\" data-name=\"check progress bar fill (full)\"></span></span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</button>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"rise rounded-[14px] bg-white p-6\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-2\" data-name=\"detailed check card: Search engines can tell who you are\" style=\"box-shadow:0 18px 40px -28px rgba(39,39,39,0.45)\">\n<div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-start justify-between gap-3\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-2-1\" data-name=\"detail card header\">\n<h2 class=\"max-w-[28ch] text-[24px] font-semibold leading-[1.2] tracking-[-0.01em]\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-2-1-1\" data-name=\"detail card heading: Search engines can tell who you are\" style=\"font-family:'Bricolage Grotesque',system-ui,sans-serif\">Search engines can tell who you are</h2>\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-[#EFF1F3] px-3 py-1 text-[12px] font-bold\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-2-1-2\" data-name=\"status badge: Needs attention\">\n<i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ph ph-warning-circle text-[15px] text-[#696773]\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"warning icon in badge\"></i>\n          Needs attention\n        </span>\n</div>\n<p class=\"mt-3 text-[13px] text-[#696773]\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-2-2\" data-name=\"points available line\">0 of 20 points available</p>\n<p class=\"mt-4 max-w-[66ch] text-[16px] leading-[1.65]\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-2-3\" data-name=\"check description paragraph\">Your site doesn't describe your organization in the standard format that search engines and AI assistants read directly.</p>\n<div class=\"mt-5 border-t border-[#E3E7EA] pt-4\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-2-4\" data-name=\"why-it-matters section\">\n<p class=\"text-[12px] font-bold text-[#696773]\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-2-4-1\" data-name=\"why-it-matters heading\">Why it matters</p>\n<p class=\"mt-1.5 max-w-[66ch] text-[16px] leading-[1.65] text-[#696773]\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-2-4-2\" data-name=\"why-it-matters explanation text\">Without it they have to guess your name, purpose and website from the page text, and may get it wrong or leave you out.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mt-5 grid grid-cols-3 gap-3 border-t border-[#E3E7EA] pt-4\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-2-5\" data-name=\"metadata column group (Effort / Where / Method)\">\n<div data-kid=\"1-1-4-2-5-1\" data-name=\"metadata item: Effort\">\n<p class=\"text-[12px] text-[#696773]\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-2-5-1-1\" data-name=\"metadata label: Effort\">Effort</p>\n<p class=\"mt-1 text-[15px] leading-snug\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-2-5-1-2\" data-name=\"metadata value: About 10 minutes\">About 10 minutes</p>\n</div>\n<div data-kid=\"1-1-4-2-5-2\" data-name=\"metadata item: Where\">\n<p class=\"text-[12px] text-[#696773]\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-2-5-2-1\" data-name=\"metadata label: Where\">Where</p>\n<p class=\"mt-1 text-[15px] leading-snug\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-2-5-2-2\" data-name=\"metadata value: / (homepage)\">/ (homepage)</p>\n</div>\n<div data-kid=\"1-1-4-2-5-3\" data-name=\"metadata item: Method\">\n<p class=\"text-[12px] text-[#696773]\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-2-5-3-1\" data-name=\"metadata label: Method\">Method</p>\n<p class=\"mt-1 text-[15px] leading-snug\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-2-5-3-2\" data-name=\"metadata value: WordPress fix\">WordPress fix</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mt-5 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-2-6\" data-name=\"call-to-action row\">\n<a class=\"inline-flex h-10 items-center gap-2 rounded-[10px] bg-[#019FB7] px-4 text-[14px] font-bold text-[#12222A]\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-2-6-1\" data-name=\"primary button: Review proposed change\" href=\"#\">\n          Review proposed change\n          <i aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"ph ph-arrow-right text-[15px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-2-6-1-1\" data-name=\"right arrow icon in button\"></i>\n</a>\n<a class=\"text-[13px] text-[#696773] underline underline-offset-4\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-2-6-2\" data-name=\"secondary link: View fix steps\" href=\"#\">View fix steps</a>\n</div>\n<p class=\"mt-4 text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-[#696773]\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-2-7\" data-name=\"technical detail footnote\">Technical detail: no ld+json blocks on / (homepage)</p>\n</section>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
